  "The nine remaining differences are precision: two traces where a brush and a curve facet tie (mp_beach, norway; retail's facet plane is built in float, fnTech3's in double, so the tie breaks the other way), one curve bevel placed 0.027 units apart (mp_ice, the facet winding cut in double), and six traces around turned brush models whose rotations differ in the last bits (forest three, norway one, mp_ice two).",
